"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a><figcaption class=\"image-caption\">Buy strength….buy signals annotated with white arrow. </figcaption></figure></div><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!iGhl!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ffc8a3665-8a6d-4214-80ae-be45685ab29d_1181x706.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!iGhl!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ffc8a3665-8a6d-4214-80ae-be45685ab29d_1181x706.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!iGhl!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ffc8a3665-8a6d-4214-80ae-be45685ab29d_1181x706.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!iGhl!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ffc8a3665-8a6d-4214-80ae-be45685ab29d_1181x706.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!iGhl!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ffc8a3665-8a6d-4214-80ae-be45685ab29d_1181x706.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!iGhl!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ffc8a3665-8a6d-4214-80ae-be45685ab29d_1181x706.png\" width=\"1181\" height=\"706\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/fc8a3665-8a6d-4214-80ae-be45685ab29d_1181x706.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:706,&quot;width&quot;:1181,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:343120,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/i/180710466?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ffc8a3665-8a6d-4214-80ae-be45685ab29d_1181x706.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!iGhl!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ffc8a3665-8a6d-4214-80ae-be45685ab29d_1181x706.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!iGhl!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ffc8a3665-8a6d-4214-80ae-be45685ab29d_1181x706.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!iGhl!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ffc8a3665-8a6d-4214-80ae-be45685ab29d_1181x706.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!iGhl!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ffc8a3665-8a6d-4214-80ae-be45685ab29d_1181x706.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a><figcaption class=\"image-caption\">Not dips….</figcaption></figure></div><h4>In summary, some new rules to improve our already good odds:</h4><ol><li><p>VIX must be less than 21. </p></li><li><p>Price must be over 10, 20 and 50 day moving average (along with the 150 and 200 that we were already using). </p></li><li><p>Target stocks with 400m total shares, or less. </p></li><li><p>Target stocks that have trended up for at least a month already. </p></li><li><p>Target stocks between $4.5B and $18B. </p></li><li><p>Stocks gapping up are preferable…though not a hard rule. </p></li></ol><p>Can stocks still flop by following all these rules? Yes, of course, we are just looking to improve our batting percentage for big wins. Can stocks not abiding by these rules do well? Of course. But by following a set of rules and guidelines, over time, we will have more wins. </p><p>Oh yea…<strong>if you actually like this content, like it and re-post</strong>. Thanks! Also…I know some of you may not know me. <em><strong>If you would like a free week in my Substack, send me a DM and I will set you up.</strong></em> You can test out the screener and ask others their experience with it, and ask me questions!</p><p>Ill update the screener with the new rules, but need a little time. If you have questions, feel free to ping me in the <a href=\"https://open.substack.com/chat/posts/a6d22673-3c49-4158-9976-805111a110bd\">Main Chat</a>. For now lets give these new rules a test spin manually, by evaluating the stocks from the StockTok screener yesterday, and buy a stock!</p><p>Update 12/5: <a href=\"https://substack.com/@stocktok/note/c-184531299?r=4z8lgl&amp;utm_source=notes-share-action&amp;utm_medium=web\">Not all the bad stocks were bad…</a></p><h4>The stock I bought is…👇</h4>",
